# Docker patterns are not recursive, so every one of these needs its ** prefix: the only
# TestResults this project produces is Tests/TestResults, and the only .user file lives
# beside ORMConvertorAPI.csproj - root-anchored patterns missed both and let a local
# coverage run enter the build context through `COPY . .`.
**/bin
**/obj
**/TestResults
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/*.log
.vs
.vscode
.idea
.env
